===========================================================
SECTION 0 — NON-NEGOTIABLE PRODUCT IDENTITY
===========================================================

Nexora is an independent social networking platform.

Its core purpose is to connect real people through content, communication, communities, discovery and commerce.

The platform takes useful interaction inspiration from:

- Instagram: feed, stories, profiles, reels, direct messaging.
- Snapchat: camera, creative filters and stories.
- Discord: organized communities and channels.
- Slack: structured group communication and administration.
- Pinterest: visual discovery and collections.
- Modern social commerce: product discovery and shopping.
- Modern location-based social applications: optional proximity discovery.

These are functional references, not templates to copy.

NEXORA MUST NOT BECOME AN AI BOT PLATFORM.

Remove and do not implement:

- OpenBot-style interfaces.
- AI agent marketplaces.
- Bot creation.
- Bot profiles.
- Bot directories.
- Autonomous bot teams.
- AI employee dashboards.
- Bot management systems.
- Bot-centric inboxes.
- Bot-specific navigation.
- Agent personality configuration.

AI can power backend capabilities such as recommendation, visual search, moderation assistance and virtual try-on.

It must not become the product's identity.

The central participants are HUMAN USERS.

